OL,3,GNEWSAWoman suffers serious sexual
OL,4,Aassault while walking dog near park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman suffered a serious sexual
OL,7,Fassault when she was attacked by a man
OL,8,Fwhile walking her dog near a park in
OL,9,FBlantyre.
OL,11,FThe attack happened at about 22:00 on
OL,12,FTuesday near an open grassy area off
OL,13,FWesterpark Avenue, near to Abernethy
OL,14,FAvenue, in the South Lanarkshire town.
OL,16,FThe woman was approached by a man who
OL,17,Fshe didn't know and subjected to a
OL,18,Fserious sexual assault.
OL,20,FThe man is described as a white male,
OL,21,F5ft 9in (1.75m) tall and was wearing
OL,22,Fdark clothing and a black beanie hat.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
